<item>
<title><![CDATA[smudge day!! &amp; i gottttta thank a few people -thank you @jim...]]></title>
<link>https://pixnoy.com/post/6741133444454159241829</link>
<guid>https://pixnoy.com/post/6741133444454159241829</guid>
<description>
<![CDATA[
smudge day!! &amp; i gottttta thank a few people -thank you @jim_at_thehouse / @jimbergsonprod for somehow managing to jump inside my head and materialize the exact sounds i was hearing in my brain. you’re THE coolest. ever.thank you @marsdenmastering for putting the finishing touches on everything. did i cry when i got the final master—maybe.thank you @kodaabreu for lending your time and talent, and for standing in the rain and bitter cold with your very expensive camera.thank you @djcuzzinb and freaking NPR MSIC for featuring this song last year??? i literally would’ve never recorded it, but The People™️ would not stop pounding at my door for it bc of your platform and your decision to put me on it. thank you thank you thank you.&amp; finally, thank you to everyone who’s already streamed this song. or shared this song. or cried to this song. keep streaming, keep sharing, keep crying.<p><img src="https://prank-arum.github.io/Feeds/Instagram/caseyruthlittle/6741133444454159241829.jpg">]]>
</description>
<pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 16:37:34 -0500</pubDate>
</item>
